    {
      "source": "Create a new <code>MockHttpServletRequest</code> with a default\n<a href=\"MockServletContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.mock.web\"><code>MockServletContext</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的带有默认<a href=\"MockServletContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.mock.web\"><code>MockServletContext</code></a>的<code>MockHttpServletRequest</code>。",
      "count": 5
    },
    {
      "source": "If no locales have been explicitly configured, the default,\npreferred <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Locale.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Locale</code></a> for the <em>server</em> mocked by this\nrequest is <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Locale.html#ENGLISH\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Locale.ENGLISH</code></a>.",
      "translation": "如果未显式配置任何区域设置，则此请求所模拟的 <em>服务器</em> 将使用默认的首选 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Locale.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Locale</code></a>，即 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Locale.html#ENGLISH\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Locale.ENGLISH</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "In contrast to the Servlet specification, this mock implementation\ndoes <strong>not</strong> take into consideration any locales\nspecified via the <code>Accept-Language</code> header.",
      "translation": "与 Servlet 规范不同，此模拟实现不会考虑通过`Accept-Language` 头指定的任何区域设置。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "If there are already one or more values registered for the given\nparameter name, they will be replaced.",
      "translation": "如果已为该参数名注册了一个或多个值，它们将被替换。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Return <code>true</code> if the <a href=\"#setSecure(boolean)\"><code>secure</code></a> flag has been set\nto <code>true</code> or if the <a href=\"#getScheme()\"><code>scheme</code></a> is <code>https</code>.",
      "translation": "返回 `<code>true</code>`，如果已设置 `<a href=\"#setSecure(boolean)\"><code>secure</code></a>` 标志为 `<code>true</code>`，或者 `<a href=\"#getScheme()\"><code>scheme</code></a>` 为 `<code>https</code>`。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Get the content of the request body as a <code>String</code>, using the configured\n<a href=\"#getCharacterEncoding()\">character encoding</a>.",
      "translation": "使用配置的<a href=\"#getCharacterEncoding()\">字符编码</a>，将请求体内容获取为<code>String</code>。",
      "count": 3
    },
