      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "The default, preferred <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Locale.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Locale</code></a> for the <em>server</em> mocked by this request\nis <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Locale.html#ENGLISH\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Locale.ENGLISH</code></a>. This value can be changed via <a href=\"#addPreferredLocale(java.util.Locale)\"><code>addPreferredLocale(Locale)</code></a>\nor <a href=\"#setPreferredLocales(java.util.List)\"><code>setPreferredLocales(List)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "此请求所模拟的 <em>服务器</em> 的默认首选 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Locale.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Locale</code></a> 为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Locale.html#ENGLISH\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Locale.ENGLISH</code></a>。该值可通过 <a href=\"#addPreferredLocale(java.util.Locale)\"><code>addPreferredLocale(Locale)</code></a> 或 <a href=\"#setPreferredLocales(java.util.List)\"><code>setPreferredLocales(List)</code></a> 进行更改。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The preferred locale will be set to <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Locale.html#ENGLISH\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Locale.ENGLISH</code></a>.",
      "translation": "首选区域设置将设置为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Locale.html#ENGLISH\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Locale.ENGLISH</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "If the supplied byte array represents text such as XML or JSON, the\n<a href=\"#setCharacterEncoding(java.lang.String)\"><code>character encoding</code></a> should typically be\nset as well.",
      "translation": "如果提供的字节数组表示文本（如 XML 或 JSON），通常还应设置<a href=\"#setCharacterEncoding(java.lang.String)\"><code>字符编码</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "While this method can take any <code>Object</code> as a parameter,\nit is recommended to use the following types:",
      "translation": "虽然此方法可以接受任何 `<code>Object</code>` 作为参数，但建议使用以下类型：",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "If there are already one or more values registered for the given\nparameter name, the given value will be added to the end of the list.",
      "translation": "如果已为给定的参数名注册了一个或多个值，则给定值将添加到列表末尾。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "If there are already one or more values registered for the given\nparameter name, the given values will be added to the end of the list.",
