      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "If the internal value representation is a String, this method will try\nto parse it as a date using the supported date formats:",
      "translation": "如果内部值表示为 String，此方法将尝试使用支持的日期格式将其解析为日期：",
      "count": 2
