    {
      "source": "Set all provided parameters <strong>replacing</strong> any existing\nvalues for the provided parameter names. To add without replacing\nexisting values, use <a href=\"#addParameters(java.util.Map)\"><code>addParameters(java.util.Map)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "设置所有提供的参数，<strong>替换</strong>现有参数的值。若要添加而不替换现有值，请使用<a href=\"#addParameters(java.util.Map)\"><code>addParameters(java.util.Map)</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
