      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The implementation of this (Servlet 3.1+) method calls\n<a href=\"MockHttpSession.html#changeSessionId()\"><code>MockHttpSession.changeSessionId()</code></a> if the session is a mock session.\nOtherwise it simply returns the current session id.",
